WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.900 --> 01:31.160
[My Journey to You]

01:31.180 --> 01:34.000
[Episode 12]

01:49.020 --> 01:50.259
I heard from the servants

01:50.259 --> 01:52.060
that you didn't eat much dinner.

01:52.420 --> 01:53.539
I was afraid you would be hungry.

01:53.539 --> 01:54.750
So I made some cakes

01:54.920 --> 01:56.100
and tea.

01:56.200 --> 01:58.060
They can help to calm your nerves.

01:58.630 --> 01:59.780
I wanted to go to the clinic

01:59.780 --> 02:01.750
and get some herbal medicines which help to calm nerves.

02:01.750 --> 02:03.820
But since the Gong residence became heavily guarded,

02:03.820 --> 02:05.020
Young Master Yuanzhi

02:05.110 --> 02:08.060
has placed many restrictions on the acquiring of medicine in the clinic.

02:08.060 --> 02:09.610
So I went to the kitchen,

02:09.690 --> 02:11.340
took some ready-made food,

02:11.770 --> 02:13.970
and made some mimosa flower tea for you.

02:17.730 --> 02:18.530
Don't bother.

02:19.420 --> 02:20.250
Let's eat together.

02:20.250 --> 02:21.030
Chat with me.

02:52.500 --> 02:53.380
Young Master,

02:54.150 --> 02:56.280
are you still thinking about Lady Lan?

02:57.840 --> 02:59.370
Since childhood, I thought

03:00.620 --> 03:01.930
I was observant

03:02.250 --> 03:03.190
and sensitive.

03:05.530 --> 03:06.390
But it turns out

03:07.870 --> 03:10.270
I never knew what my parents were thinking.

03:13.450 --> 03:15.020
And my brother who died.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.160
It seems

03:19.840 --> 03:21.800
that I never really knew them.

03:24.300 --> 03:26.520
You suddenly lost your father and brother

03:26.520 --> 03:28.180
and became the Sword Wielder.

03:28.730 --> 03:29.790
And in a short time,

03:29.970 --> 03:31.630
you have to pass three trials.

03:32.180 --> 03:35.190
Murders also happened again and again in the Gong residence.

03:35.190 --> 03:36.650
You must be very stressed.

03:38.420 --> 03:39.950
No matter how stressed I am,

03:40.420 --> 03:41.550
I can't say I'm tired

03:42.110 --> 03:43.110
or complain.

03:44.450 --> 03:45.380
I can't

03:45.980 --> 03:48.310
let people think I'm incompetent either.

03:49.470 --> 03:50.190
Otherwise,

03:51.079 --> 03:52.680
people who are in the shadows

03:53.500 --> 03:54.960
will take advantage of it.

03:57.940 --> 03:59.310
You can tell me

04:00.530 --> 04:01.790
about your suffering.

04:04.660 --> 04:05.530
Although

04:06.050 --> 04:07.380
I'm not good at speaking

04:08.160 --> 04:10.020
and don't know how to comfort you,

04:11.220 --> 04:13.140
I can be your listener

04:14.460 --> 04:15.700
or sing for you.

04:17.500 --> 04:19.100
You're not good at speaking?

04:20.680 --> 04:22.300
You're eloquent.

04:26.320 --> 04:26.890
But

04:28.580 --> 04:30.310
even if you're a caring flower,

04:31.920 --> 04:32.830
I don't want

04:33.680 --> 04:35.010
to make you worry.

04:37.570 --> 04:38.770
No caring flower

04:40.240 --> 04:42.440
minds listening to people's problems.

04:44.150 --> 04:45.409
You don't understand.

04:47.020 --> 04:49.280
Growing flowers and grasses isn't easy.

04:49.360 --> 04:50.960
If people keep complaining,

04:51.520 --> 04:53.120
they won't flourish.

04:54.300 --> 04:54.850
Really?

04:55.370 --> 04:55.970
Of course.

04:56.900 --> 04:58.790
It's like if you keep saying bad words

04:58.790 --> 05:00.290
to a glass of water,

05:00.820 --> 05:02.480
the water will become cloudy.

05:03.660 --> 05:04.530
Are you lying?

05:05.070 --> 05:06.200
I'm not lying to you.

05:08.020 --> 05:08.680
So,

05:09.180 --> 05:11.110
the same goes for growing flowers.

05:11.670 --> 05:13.600
What should people say to flowers?

05:15.960 --> 05:16.650
We should

05:17.620 --> 05:19.080
praise her for her beauty,

05:19.780 --> 05:21.640
praise her for being thoughtful,

05:22.020 --> 05:23.680
praise her for being lovable,

05:24.620 --> 05:26.420
praise her for being sensitive,

05:28.490 --> 05:30.150
and praise her for having eyes

05:30.920 --> 05:32.120
which are like stars.

05:33.970 --> 05:35.300
Flowers also have eyes?

05:38.270 --> 05:40.000
I'm not talking about flowers.

05:49.770 --> 05:50.770
You're blushing.

05:54.830 --> 05:55.520
It's late.

05:56.580 --> 05:57.840
You should rest early.

05:57.860 --> 05:58.590
I'm leaving.

06:03.510 --> 06:04.570
She really got shy.

06:18.950 --> 06:19.880
It doesn't work.

06:20.950 --> 06:22.410
There's half a month left.

06:23.050 --> 06:24.030
What should I do?

07:02.180 --> 07:03.440
Why are you still here?

07:04.480 --> 07:05.530
This is my home.

07:07.690 --> 07:08.750
Why should I leave?

07:10.140 --> 07:11.930
Why did you

07:12.020 --> 07:14.220
keep looking at the tiger embroidery just now?

07:14.220 --> 07:15.350
You were in a trance.

07:19.660 --> 07:21.790
That belonged to his younger brother.

07:23.610 --> 07:25.670
Is he Brother Lang whom you mentioned

07:25.710 --> 07:26.540
just now?

07:27.750 --> 07:28.150
Yes.

07:33.050 --> 07:35.450
Why can you always hear our conversations?

07:36.550 --> 07:38.350
You like eavesdropping, right?

07:41.740 --> 07:43.659
You should ask yourself

07:43.960 --> 07:45.790
if you're coming to the Jue residence

07:45.790 --> 07:47.120
too often.

07:48.540 --> 07:51.270
Is it uncomfortable to live in the Zhi residence?

07:52.130 --> 07:53.980
It's proper for me

07:54.220 --> 07:56.080
to come and see my future husband.

07:57.300 --> 07:58.640
You're almost an adult.

07:59.030 --> 08:00.540
Find a wife.

08:01.510 --> 08:03.140
Don't pester your brother every day.

08:03.140 --> 08:04.470
Mind your own business.

08:06.880 --> 08:07.940
It doesn't matter.

08:08.060 --> 08:09.180
If you don't tell me,

08:09.180 --> 08:10.580
I'll ask him later.

08:10.580 --> 08:11.380
Don't ask him.

08:14.880 --> 08:17.480
If you ask, he'll remember the sad thing again.

08:18.820 --> 08:20.050
What is the sad thing?

08:24.820 --> 08:25.420
My brother

08:27.490 --> 08:29.350
had a biological younger brother

08:34.059 --> 08:35.260
who he loved the most.

08:38.350 --> 08:40.080
Aren't you the younger brother

08:41.090 --> 08:42.289
who he loves the most?

08:49.620 --> 08:50.430
In his heart,

08:53.110 --> 08:55.040
no one can compare to Brother Lang.

08:55.220 --> 08:55.710
Mother.

08:56.710 --> 08:57.240
Oh.

08:58.030 --> 08:59.360
Young Master Shangjue.

08:59.640 --> 09:02.500
You're here to pick up your mother and brother again?

09:02.500 --> 09:04.090
I don't know if it's a boy or a girl.

09:04.090 --> 09:07.150
Mr. Jingjie said it's my brother. Then it's my brother.

09:07.220 --> 09:08.680
Okay. It's your brother.

09:10.210 --> 09:10.820
Shangjue.

09:12.060 --> 09:13.260
Which one do you like?

09:14.580 --> 09:15.580
The little tiger.

09:15.960 --> 09:17.370
You're an elder brother now.

09:17.370 --> 09:17.980
In the future,

09:17.980 --> 09:19.220
take good care of your younger brother.

09:19.220 --> 09:20.210
Sure.

09:38.570 --> 09:41.100
Brother, I want to practice using knives too.

09:43.820 --> 09:45.070
You're still a kid.

09:45.670 --> 09:46.930
You'll hurt yourself.

09:47.060 --> 09:48.920
Brother, this dagger looks good.

09:59.160 --> 09:59.860
Great!

09:59.890 --> 10:01.830
I can also practice using knives.

10:03.520 --> 10:06.940
I can also practice using knives.

10:13.630 --> 10:14.210
Then

10:14.450 --> 10:16.800
why have I never seen Brother Lang?

10:18.560 --> 10:19.440
Ten years ago,

10:20.690 --> 10:21.690
he and Lady Ling

10:24.210 --> 10:26.610
were both killed by people from the Wufeng.

10:36.380 --> 10:37.290
Anyway,

10:39.180 --> 10:40.180
don't ask around.

11:03.510 --> 11:04.840
Young Master Shangjue.

11:20.980 --> 11:21.510
Leave it.

11:33.810 --> 11:34.740
Why are you here?

11:36.300 --> 11:37.700
The servants heard something

11:37.700 --> 11:39.120
being broken.

11:39.860 --> 11:41.120
They dared not come in.

11:41.620 --> 11:44.080
They were afraid that they would offend you.

11:46.100 --> 11:47.460
But you dared to come in?

11:50.110 --> 11:51.110
I'm scared too.

11:53.020 --> 11:53.820
But I know

11:55.010 --> 11:56.540
no matter how angry you are,

11:57.190 --> 11:57.980
there should be someone

11:57.980 --> 11:59.340
in the room serving you.

12:01.580 --> 12:02.260
Besides,

12:02.260 --> 12:03.010
I know

12:04.140 --> 12:05.730
although you look scary,

12:08.130 --> 12:09.790
you're actually very gentle.

12:15.380 --> 12:15.980
Come here.

12:22.020 --> 12:23.020
Give me your hand.

12:26.500 --> 12:27.940
How do you know

12:28.480 --> 12:29.740
my hand was scratched?

12:33.100 --> 12:33.730
The smell.

12:36.220 --> 12:38.480
I've been in the martial world for years.

12:38.940 --> 12:41.200
I'm very sensitive to the smell of blood.

13:13.920 --> 13:15.580
Do you still think I'm gentle?

13:24.890 --> 13:26.290
It's just a minor injury.

13:30.180 --> 13:32.230
Fingers and hearts are inseparably linked.

13:32.230 --> 13:33.290
It hurts.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.510
I have to say it.

13:36.980 --> 13:39.310
If you say it, will your hand stop hurting?

13:40.420 --> 13:41.330
If you say it,

13:42.650 --> 13:44.780
will the wound heal without medicine?

13:47.410 --> 13:47.800
No.

13:50.020 --> 13:51.220
But when I was a child,

13:52.080 --> 13:53.740
every time I skinned my knees,

13:54.820 --> 13:56.150
my mother

13:58.180 --> 13:59.040
would...

14:01.700 --> 14:03.830
When she was applying medicine for me,

14:05.740 --> 14:06.510
she said,

14:08.030 --> 14:09.800
"Qian, if it hurts,

14:10.870 --> 14:12.310
tell me."

14:15.410 --> 14:17.450
Every time my mother told me this,

14:18.490 --> 14:19.670
the wound

14:20.570 --> 14:21.830
didn't hurt that much.

14:24.410 --> 14:25.600
Isn't it good

14:26.580 --> 14:27.600
to be cared about?

14:34.760 --> 14:35.960
The world of children

14:37.170 --> 14:39.300
is different from the world of adults.

14:40.480 --> 14:41.680
In the martial world,

14:42.540 --> 14:43.890
happiness and prestige

14:44.630 --> 14:46.400
can be shared and shown.

14:48.150 --> 14:49.360
But pains and secrets

14:51.550 --> 14:52.680
cannot be revealed.

14:56.190 --> 14:57.300
So people

14:58.450 --> 15:00.220
often laugh with others.

15:01.780 --> 15:03.050
But few people

15:04.970 --> 15:06.320
cry with others.

15:09.580 --> 15:10.270
Few.

15:11.750 --> 15:12.650
But not zero.

15:24.380 --> 15:26.310
If you bury the wounds in your heart

15:26.860 --> 15:28.420
and touch them

15:28.600 --> 15:29.690
again and again,

15:30.340 --> 15:32.190
you'll have more scars.

15:37.240 --> 15:39.170
Have you ever seen wounded beasts?

15:40.370 --> 15:42.670
They don't show their wounds to others.

15:43.850 --> 15:46.710
Because the weak cannot be tolerated in the colony.

15:47.560 --> 15:49.970
They just find a dark cave

15:51.120 --> 15:52.850
and lick their wounds quietly,

15:53.580 --> 15:54.780
waiting for recovery

15:56.280 --> 15:57.300
or death.

16:03.130 --> 16:04.590
But humans are not beasts.

16:06.460 --> 16:07.720
Beasts have no hearts,

16:08.300 --> 16:09.140
but humans do.

16:10.180 --> 16:10.860
A heart

16:11.300 --> 16:13.010
must have a place to stay.

16:14.370 --> 16:15.950
If you have someone

16:16.330 --> 16:18.140
who can boil snow and warm alcohol for you,

16:18.140 --> 16:20.270
even if it's not bright and hot enough,

16:20.970 --> 16:24.100
it'll be enough for you to spend the winter in your heart.

16:25.500 --> 16:27.680
But not everyone in your heart

16:28.650 --> 16:30.850
will warm up a bottle of alcohol for you.

16:31.570 --> 16:32.300
Maybe

16:33.390 --> 16:34.710
he'll leave a scar

16:35.710 --> 16:36.710
on your heart.

16:40.060 --> 16:40.920
Go to the clinic

16:41.130 --> 16:41.820
tomorrow.

16:43.800 --> 16:45.600
The minor injury isn't serious.

16:46.030 --> 16:47.360
That's not what I meant.

16:48.340 --> 16:48.690
Hmm?

16:50.780 --> 16:51.840
Your hands are hot.

16:52.710 --> 16:55.100
The temperature of your hands isn't normal.

16:55.100 --> 16:56.830
It's caused by either sickness

16:56.840 --> 16:57.650
or poison.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.200
I caught a cold a few days ago.

17:03.030 --> 17:03.880
I'm feverish.

17:04.579 --> 17:05.980
Have you taken medicine?

17:07.180 --> 17:07.730
No.

17:09.940 --> 17:11.599
After Elder Yue was killed,

17:12.220 --> 17:13.510
people need Young Master Yuanzhi's permission

17:13.510 --> 17:15.240
to come in and out of the clinic.

17:16.030 --> 17:18.960
The rules on the acquiring of medicine are stricter.

17:24.460 --> 17:25.460
Take my token

17:25.950 --> 17:26.950
and ask the doctor

17:27.079 --> 17:29.140
to give you the medicine you request.

17:30.510 --> 17:31.950
This token is...

17:32.260 --> 17:33.520
In the Gong residence,

17:33.800 --> 17:35.660
you're allowed to go everywhere.

17:41.530 --> 17:42.590
Thank you, my lord.

17:55.620 --> 17:57.020
This box contains

17:57.020 --> 17:58.880
some of your father's old things.

18:02.790 --> 18:04.390
I didn't give it to you before

18:04.720 --> 18:06.580
because I didn't want you to be sad

18:06.830 --> 18:08.080
when you see it.

18:09.360 --> 18:09.900
Now,

18:11.000 --> 18:12.260
I should give it to you.

19:02.750 --> 19:06.200
New Snow leans on Taiyuan.

19:10.800 --> 19:11.930
Start from New Snow.

19:12.500 --> 19:14.560
Use strength at the Taiyuan acupoint.

19:14.560 --> 19:16.330
The wrists are the most flexible

19:16.330 --> 19:17.040
and the moves

19:17.040 --> 19:18.250
are the fastest.

19:20.180 --> 19:20.780
Air Frost.

19:21.190 --> 19:23.050
Use strength at the Chize acupoint.

19:23.050 --> 19:25.910
Using elbows to keep control is the most effective.

19:26.100 --> 19:28.300
As for Cold Wave, using strength at the Yunmen acupoint

19:28.300 --> 19:31.330
can stimulate all the energy and blood in the upper body

19:31.330 --> 19:33.530
and increase the pressure of the knife.

19:37.810 --> 19:39.470
You began to practice at dawn.

19:41.500 --> 19:43.160
Did you learn it from an expert

19:43.260 --> 19:45.170
or figure it out by yourself?

19:46.050 --> 19:47.510
I learnt it from an expert.

19:49.090 --> 19:50.060
Xue Chongzi.

19:50.060 --> 19:51.780
In order to ask you to take him out for fun,

19:51.780 --> 19:53.100
he helped you cheat.

19:54.670 --> 19:56.130
I learnt it from my father.

19:56.780 --> 19:58.040
Former Sword Wielder?

20:22.640 --> 20:23.440
What a bad day.

20:30.600 --> 20:31.520
You promised

20:32.450 --> 20:35.050
that you would find Anonymous within ten days.

20:36.050 --> 20:37.180
The deadline is up.

20:38.060 --> 20:39.250
Logically speaking,

20:39.250 --> 20:40.510
Young Master Shangjue

20:40.560 --> 20:43.360
should come to the Yu residence and report it to me.

20:43.550 --> 20:44.970
But I was worried

20:45.660 --> 20:46.780
Young Master Shangjue didn't find the truth

20:46.780 --> 20:48.180
and was ashamed to see me.

20:48.820 --> 20:49.440
So,

20:50.480 --> 20:52.010
I specifically came here to ask you.

20:52.010 --> 20:54.270
It's not that he is too ashamed to see you.

20:54.660 --> 20:56.390
He just doesn't want to see you.

20:57.220 --> 20:58.990
My brother has already found something.

20:58.990 --> 21:01.920
He's going to the Council of Elders and reporting it.

21:02.620 --> 21:03.130
Really?

21:04.630 --> 21:05.770
I've found out

21:06.140 --> 21:07.670
the identity of Anonymous.

21:07.980 --> 21:09.030
I was going to

21:09.340 --> 21:10.870
discuss it with the elders.

21:12.810 --> 21:13.970
Since you

21:14.540 --> 21:15.670
came here in person,

21:16.740 --> 21:18.270
I can tell you first.

21:18.800 --> 21:19.810
But I don't know

21:21.030 --> 21:21.930
if you

21:23.090 --> 21:24.160
can take it.

21:35.180 --> 21:36.640
There are three suspects.

21:37.090 --> 21:37.820
The first one

21:38.290 --> 21:40.220
is the leader of Yellow Jade guardians.

21:40.220 --> 21:41.020
The second one

21:41.460 --> 21:43.790
is the housekeeper of the Council of Elders.

21:43.790 --> 21:44.900
But these two people

21:44.900 --> 21:46.670
are temporarily cleared.

21:48.130 --> 21:48.970
Then there's

21:49.290 --> 21:50.620
the third suspect left.

21:53.180 --> 21:54.040
Lady Wuji.

21:55.890 --> 21:57.150
You were pushed so hard

21:57.380 --> 21:58.300
so you want to frame her, right?

21:58.300 --> 21:58.910
Hey.

21:59.580 --> 22:01.310
We have proof.

22:02.380 --> 22:03.850
When you questioned my blood

22:03.850 --> 22:05.250
in the Council of Elders,

22:05.380 --> 22:07.030
you also had proof.

22:07.540 --> 22:08.030
What?

22:08.980 --> 22:10.980
Weren't you given a slap in the face?

22:13.820 --> 22:14.860
That's why

22:16.420 --> 22:18.060
we won't let you gloat again.

22:19.530 --> 22:20.070
Besides,

22:21.360 --> 22:22.730
we also want you to know

22:23.820 --> 22:25.350
how a slap in the face feels.

22:25.690 --> 22:27.340
We interrogated all the guardians

22:27.340 --> 22:29.580
who were on guard that night

22:29.780 --> 22:30.750
and found out

22:31.570 --> 22:33.340
that no one knew where the three people were

22:33.340 --> 22:35.250
on the night Elder Yue was killed.

22:36.410 --> 22:37.670
And these three people

22:38.030 --> 22:39.890
could approach Elder Yue easily.

22:40.610 --> 22:43.010
Then why are you only suspecting Lady Wuji?

22:43.620 --> 22:44.790
Why don't you hide

22:45.170 --> 22:46.450
your ulterior motive?

22:47.320 --> 22:48.250
What's the rush?

22:48.630 --> 22:50.490
He hasn't gotten to the point yet.

22:51.670 --> 22:53.980
According to the rules of the Gong family,

22:53.980 --> 22:55.510
our servants and guardians

22:55.640 --> 22:57.840
were all selected from Jiuchen Valley.

22:58.780 --> 23:00.300
Most of the people in the valley

23:00.300 --> 23:02.560
have been living there for generations.

23:03.420 --> 23:05.080
They don't know martial arts.

23:05.660 --> 23:07.330
It's hard to find spies from the Wufeng

23:07.330 --> 23:08.220
there.

23:09.720 --> 23:11.170
The leader of Yellow Jade guardians

23:11.170 --> 23:13.150
and the housekeeper of the Council of Elders

23:13.150 --> 23:14.810
are both from Jiuchen Valley.

23:15.180 --> 23:16.040
For this alone,

23:16.580 --> 23:17.640
they were cleared?

23:18.770 --> 23:20.100
That's too arbitrary.

23:20.940 --> 23:21.810
You're right.

23:23.110 --> 23:24.370
According to my style,

23:25.020 --> 23:26.380
I sent some people

23:26.380 --> 23:28.430
to investigate their backgrounds.

23:29.540 --> 23:30.900
The leader of Yellow Jade guardians

23:30.900 --> 23:31.760
is Jin Yunfeng.

23:32.230 --> 23:33.690
His surname used to be Qian.

23:33.690 --> 23:35.020
His family ran a clinic.

23:35.340 --> 23:36.870
Because of his strong body,

23:36.930 --> 23:37.930
when he was seven,

23:37.940 --> 23:39.720
he was chosen to enter the Gong residence

23:39.720 --> 23:41.180
and trained as a guardian.

23:41.910 --> 23:43.770
Later, he was granted the surname Jin.

23:43.770 --> 23:44.810
The ancestors of the housekeeper Hu Hai

23:44.810 --> 23:45.810
were carpenters.

23:46.220 --> 23:47.060
Ten years ago,

23:47.490 --> 23:50.510
he started working in the kitchen of the Council of Elders.

23:50.510 --> 23:52.420
He had been working hard for many years

23:52.420 --> 23:53.660
before being promoted

23:53.660 --> 23:56.120
to the housekeeper of the Council of Elders.

23:56.950 --> 23:58.550
These two people's families

23:58.840 --> 24:01.770
have been living in Jiuchen Valley for generations.

24:02.670 --> 24:04.300
But Lady Wuji is different.

24:05.950 --> 24:06.790
Lady Wuji

24:07.310 --> 24:09.530
became Lady Lan's servant before she married into the Gong family.

24:09.530 --> 24:11.190
She's obviously an outsider.

24:12.070 --> 24:14.130
Of course she's the most suspicious.

24:14.960 --> 24:16.420
What's more ridiculous is

24:17.020 --> 24:19.150
that her identity as a servant is fake.

24:21.040 --> 24:22.900
She's not from the Gusu family.

24:23.850 --> 24:25.710
Before entering the Yang family,

24:26.340 --> 24:27.230
her identity

24:27.340 --> 24:28.320
is unknown.

24:29.120 --> 24:30.380
What's interesting is

24:30.660 --> 24:32.250
that the year she entered the Yang family

24:32.250 --> 24:34.160
and became Lady Lan's servant

24:35.860 --> 24:38.460
was exactly the year the former Sword Wielder,

24:38.690 --> 24:40.090
your father Gong Hongyu,

24:41.010 --> 24:43.140
was attacked by people from the Wufeng

24:43.180 --> 24:44.980
near the Yang family's mansion.

24:49.330 --> 24:50.460
Everything you said

24:50.890 --> 24:52.290
is just your conjecture.

24:54.210 --> 24:55.200
I can also say

24:55.940 --> 24:57.930
because you failed to threaten Lady Wuji

24:57.930 --> 24:59.590
and have a grudge against her,

24:59.730 --> 25:01.860
you're deliberately slandering her.

25:03.780 --> 25:05.580
If you really want to accuse her,

25:05.920 --> 25:07.210
show me evidence.

25:07.710 --> 25:08.910
You said it yourself.

25:09.540 --> 25:10.590
Arguing

25:10.780 --> 25:11.710
is quite boring.

25:12.960 --> 25:14.020
It'll only make you

25:14.580 --> 25:16.070
petty people who want to use this chance

25:16.070 --> 25:17.000
to take revenge.

25:17.430 --> 25:18.730
We dare to say this

25:19.780 --> 25:21.240
because we have a witness.

25:22.260 --> 25:23.860
In the later investigation,

25:24.570 --> 25:26.570
both Jin Yunfeng and Housekeeper Hu

25:27.200 --> 25:28.480
had alibis.

25:29.550 --> 25:30.590
Only Wuji

25:31.440 --> 25:32.350
had no alibi.

25:33.580 --> 25:34.220
She said

25:35.080 --> 25:36.250
she's old.

25:37.460 --> 25:38.660
She went to bed early.

25:39.920 --> 25:41.580
It was cold at night in winter.

25:41.810 --> 25:44.070
She didn't open the door and the windows.

25:44.500 --> 25:46.230
She didn't want to catch a cold.

25:47.260 --> 25:49.390
She also specially asked the servants

25:49.810 --> 25:51.870
not to disturb her unless something happened.

25:51.870 --> 25:53.670
What Lady Wuji said is not wrong.

25:54.700 --> 25:55.620
No one can prove

25:55.620 --> 25:56.950
what they haven't done.

25:58.870 --> 25:59.870
I've also told you

26:00.740 --> 26:02.540
if you really want to accuse her,

26:03.010 --> 26:04.510
show me solid evidence.

26:06.040 --> 26:06.640
Witnesses

26:07.410 --> 26:08.500
and physical evidence.

26:08.500 --> 26:09.230
Don't worry.

26:10.340 --> 26:11.470
I'll have evidence.

26:11.980 --> 26:12.980
As long as I keep investigating...

26:12.980 --> 26:14.180
Keep investigating?

26:14.620 --> 26:15.830
Ten days are up.

26:16.730 --> 26:17.820
You failed to keep your promise.

26:17.820 --> 26:18.880
You haven't passed

26:19.060 --> 26:20.720
the Trial of the Three Realms either.

26:20.720 --> 26:21.740
There's not

26:22.000 --> 26:22.860
much time left.

26:23.220 --> 26:24.910
If you continue to be idle,

26:25.680 --> 26:27.080
you'll lose the position

26:27.500 --> 26:28.700
of the Sword Wielder.

26:34.870 --> 26:36.040
Since neither of us

26:36.180 --> 26:37.320
kept our promise,

26:38.810 --> 26:39.690
we're even.

26:40.650 --> 26:41.390
I hope

26:42.380 --> 26:43.980
you can find solid evidence.

26:44.250 --> 26:45.030
Otherwise,

26:45.580 --> 26:47.500
don't waste time in pestering Lady Wuji.

26:47.500 --> 26:50.020
I don't need you to teach me how to investigate.

26:50.020 --> 26:50.840
But you.

26:52.060 --> 26:53.470
Do you need me to teach you

26:54.700 --> 26:56.430
how to pass the next two trials?

27:25.770 --> 27:27.220
I heard you quarreling

27:27.660 --> 27:28.770
outside.

27:28.770 --> 27:29.830
It doesn't matter.

27:30.140 --> 27:31.070
Why are you here?

27:32.560 --> 27:33.980
I heard from the servants

27:34.460 --> 27:35.720
that you've been tired

27:36.250 --> 27:38.110
and haven't slept well recently.

27:38.740 --> 27:39.670
These days,

27:40.000 --> 27:42.380
you often wake up in the early hours of morning to light candles.

27:42.380 --> 27:43.700
There's a kind of pillow

27:43.700 --> 27:45.460
which can help to calm nerves in my hometown.

27:45.460 --> 27:46.940
It's made from Huangyang Mu.

27:46.940 --> 27:49.550
Putting some scented leaves

27:49.880 --> 27:51.970
which are boiled by Wuteng soup

27:52.700 --> 27:55.300
can help you to calm your nerves and sleep well.

27:57.390 --> 27:58.860
If I can find it for you

27:59.370 --> 28:00.420
from the market,

28:01.310 --> 28:02.310
you'll sleep well

28:03.060 --> 28:04.300
at night.

28:05.740 --> 28:07.740
You've entered the Gong residence.

28:09.040 --> 28:11.370
Don't always think about outside things.

28:13.060 --> 28:14.660
If you really need anything,

28:16.740 --> 28:18.200
ask the servants to buy it.

28:22.540 --> 28:23.140
Of course.

28:24.420 --> 28:25.150
Of course...

28:26.230 --> 28:27.560
The bride of the Gong family

28:27.560 --> 28:29.020
can't go in and out at will.

28:29.770 --> 28:30.770
I know the rules.

28:32.150 --> 28:33.600
I just wanted to say

28:34.690 --> 28:36.690
since Young Master Yuanzhi is here,

28:37.300 --> 28:38.570
I just wanted to ask

28:38.900 --> 28:40.160
if I can go to the clinic

28:40.460 --> 28:42.260
to see if there are these things.

28:42.460 --> 28:43.190
Go quickly.

28:44.850 --> 28:46.850
I have something to tell my brother.

28:50.980 --> 28:51.490
Yes.

28:58.120 --> 28:58.650
Brother.

28:59.420 --> 29:00.840
Lady Wuji is cunning

29:01.490 --> 29:02.680
and deceived us.

29:04.010 --> 29:05.940
If she stops committing these crimes,

29:05.940 --> 29:06.740
if we want to get evidence–

29:06.740 --> 29:07.890
She won't stop.

29:09.340 --> 29:11.490
Because her mission hasn't been completed yet.

29:11.490 --> 29:12.700
You know her mission?

29:15.090 --> 29:15.770
No.

29:17.540 --> 29:18.620
But it’s not as simple as just

29:18.620 --> 29:20.080
assassinating Elder Yue.

29:22.140 --> 29:23.740
Let’s wait for her next move.

29:25.500 --> 29:26.980
You have already adjusted

29:26.980 --> 29:28.710
the security of the Gong family

29:29.170 --> 29:31.050
and added so many

29:31.050 --> 29:33.110
hidden guards invisible to the eyes.

29:34.260 --> 29:35.440
If she kills again,

29:36.460 --> 29:37.900
she will definitely give herself away.

29:37.900 --> 29:39.830
But I won't allow her to kill again.

29:42.250 --> 29:44.310
Every drop of blood of the Gong family

29:46.730 --> 29:48.650
cannot be trampled by outsiders.

29:52.120 --> 29:53.040
Ten years ago,

29:56.330 --> 29:58.550
the promise I made gritting my teeth,

30:02.480 --> 30:03.940
I will definitely keep it.

30:25.150 --> 30:25.750
Miss Yun.

30:26.260 --> 30:27.540
You can't enter

30:27.670 --> 30:29.840
without Young Master Yuanzhi's command.

30:29.840 --> 30:30.590
I'm sick.

30:31.120 --> 30:32.810
Can't I see a doctor?

30:33.360 --> 30:34.130
You can.

30:34.450 --> 30:35.930
Miss Yun, please return home first.

30:35.930 --> 30:36.930
I will send a doctor

30:36.930 --> 30:37.860
to your residence

30:37.860 --> 30:39.330
to take your pulse and prescribe medicine

30:39.330 --> 30:41.730
and send the herbs back to Yu Lineage later.

30:46.880 --> 30:47.810
Miss Shangguan.

30:48.060 --> 30:49.950
Young Master Shangjue gave me his token

30:49.950 --> 30:50.610
to me.

30:51.340 --> 30:53.500
He asked me to come collect some medicine.

30:53.500 --> 30:54.230
Understood.

31:37.460 --> 31:39.720
You put the stones in front of the clinic.

31:39.740 --> 31:40.750
How bold of you.

31:42.970 --> 31:45.030
If I didn't put it in an obvious place,

31:45.060 --> 31:46.520
I'm afraid you won't come.

31:47.340 --> 31:48.740
The fire is burning you up

31:48.820 --> 31:49.810
and you're trying to get some medicine

31:49.810 --> 31:50.810
but can't, right?

31:52.460 --> 31:53.490
I did though.

31:54.420 --> 31:55.480
I can give you some.

31:56.060 --> 31:56.980
You're so kind?

31:59.980 --> 32:00.910
Thank you, then.

32:01.800 --> 32:03.260
Don't be anxious, sister.

32:03.900 --> 32:04.960
Take a walk with me.

32:11.790 --> 32:13.190
He's really biological?

32:14.980 --> 32:15.390
Yes.

32:17.620 --> 32:19.590
It seems that in terms of blood,

32:20.130 --> 32:23.660
it's difficult to find a breakthrough point for Gong Shangjue.

32:23.660 --> 32:24.500
If Gong Ziyu

32:24.500 --> 32:26.430
can pass the trials successfully,

32:27.140 --> 32:28.540
his position as the Sword Wielder

32:28.540 --> 32:29.640
will be concrete.

32:31.340 --> 32:32.870
You pretended to cooperate

32:33.080 --> 32:35.340
and gave me that half of the medical case.

32:35.620 --> 32:36.930
But secretly,

32:37.460 --> 32:38.920
you joined hands with Wuji

32:39.820 --> 32:43.220
to humiliate Gong Shangjue in front of the Council of Elders.

32:43.260 --> 32:44.190
At the same time,

32:44.520 --> 32:45.960
you also made yourself

32:46.160 --> 32:47.960
even more likeable to Gong Ziyu.

32:48.860 --> 32:49.930
You're amazing.

32:51.460 --> 32:53.860
Let's do it according to our capabilities.

32:53.940 --> 32:56.470
You call that according to our capabilities?

32:56.700 --> 32:58.700
Aren't you afraid of implicating me?

32:58.700 --> 32:59.980
When you forced me to get the medical record

32:59.980 --> 33:01.770
to please Gong Shangjue,

33:02.740 --> 33:04.670
you didn't consider my situation.

33:13.860 --> 33:15.860
Your internal skill is in disorder.

33:16.220 --> 33:18.150
The burning of the Fortnight Flies

33:18.410 --> 33:19.870
doesn't feel good, does it?

33:19.870 --> 33:21.930
The skill I practice is extremely yin

33:22.260 --> 33:24.500
and clashes with the burning poison directly.

33:24.500 --> 33:25.730
No matter how painful it is,

33:25.730 --> 33:27.970
it's just a disorder in my internal skill.

33:27.970 --> 33:30.900
Meanwhile, the skill you practice is extremely yang

33:31.200 --> 33:33.750
and you can't even bring up your internal skill.

33:33.750 --> 33:36.010
You must be more uncomfortable than I am.

33:37.750 --> 33:38.700
But the medicine

33:39.580 --> 33:40.760
is in my hands now.

33:41.860 --> 33:42.420
Either

33:42.820 --> 33:44.750
be obedient and cooperate with me,

33:45.300 --> 33:45.910
or

33:47.420 --> 33:48.780
be tortured slowly.

33:49.830 --> 33:50.830
These herbs

33:51.700 --> 33:54.100
can only suppress the poison temporarily.

33:54.220 --> 33:55.940
As soon as the fortnight comes,

33:55.940 --> 33:57.380
we still have to leave the Gong Residence

33:57.380 --> 33:59.640
to get the antidote from the person sent.

33:59.700 --> 34:00.360
Otherwise,

34:01.270 --> 34:02.080
we'll all die.

34:02.970 --> 34:04.430
It's just a matter of time.

34:07.790 --> 34:09.590
I will definitely find a way out.

34:11.100 --> 34:12.159
Do you even believe

34:12.420 --> 34:13.380
what you said?

34:15.690 --> 34:18.080
It must be hard to live

34:18.929 --> 34:20.730
under the nose of Gong Shangjue.

34:21.139 --> 34:23.199
You don't even dare to show your tail.

34:27.340 --> 34:29.270
Why don't you give me the medicine?

34:29.480 --> 34:31.139
I'll go exchange them for you.

34:31.600 --> 34:33.929
I've found a way out of the Gong Residence.

34:35.300 --> 34:36.230
What did you say?

34:51.860 --> 34:52.920
Thank you, Sister.

34:56.239 --> 34:57.840
Can you give me the medicine?

34:58.850 --> 34:59.430
Yes.

35:00.490 --> 35:01.210
But...

35:01.620 --> 35:03.150
we don't have enough herbs.

35:04.230 --> 35:06.030
You're going back on your words?

35:07.190 --> 35:08.670
You underestimate me.

35:09.150 --> 35:10.740
I never go back on my words.

35:12.590 --> 35:13.450
Go to the clinic

35:13.740 --> 35:14.810
with me again.

35:24.100 --> 35:24.980
Thank you.

35:25.790 --> 35:26.900
Look at my memory.

35:27.010 --> 35:28.210
I forgot these herbs.

35:29.300 --> 35:29.950
I have to

35:30.250 --> 35:32.180
thank Sister Yun for reminding me.

35:54.240 --> 35:57.360
[Shang]

36:03.020 --> 36:04.080
Eldest Young Miss.

36:05.780 --> 36:06.950
It's so hard.

36:08.230 --> 36:09.160
So hard.

36:09.260 --> 36:10.140
Why praise me?

36:12.180 --> 36:13.420
It's so hard.

36:13.470 --> 36:14.460
Eldest Young Miss.

36:14.460 --> 36:16.330
Why are you working here alone again?

36:16.330 --> 36:18.410
Where are your servants from the Shang residence?

36:18.410 --> 36:20.540
They don't treat you like a lady at all.

36:20.950 --> 36:22.160
That's outrageous.

36:22.940 --> 36:23.400
Tell me.

36:24.060 --> 36:24.830
Do you want me

36:24.940 --> 36:26.740
to go knock some sense into them?

36:27.980 --> 36:29.540
On what basis?

36:30.100 --> 36:31.500
You're just a craftsman.

36:32.020 --> 36:32.830
Take this

36:33.020 --> 36:34.460
to knock on the roof

36:34.460 --> 36:35.790
to see where's leaking.

36:37.650 --> 36:39.090
What are you doing?

36:39.580 --> 36:40.480
It's so lethal.

36:45.130 --> 36:46.420
You're amazing.

36:47.060 --> 36:49.790
This must be the hidden weapon you just invented?

36:49.940 --> 36:52.000
This is the dessert I made for Jin Fan.

36:52.150 --> 36:53.690
What did Jin Fan do wrong?

36:54.210 --> 36:55.780
He doesn't deserve this, does he?

36:55.780 --> 36:56.340
Shut up!

36:58.560 --> 36:59.610
Eldest Young Miss,

36:59.610 --> 37:01.650
how long has it been since you last did research with me?

37:01.650 --> 37:03.220
Things like research

37:03.540 --> 37:04.890
require persistence.

37:05.090 --> 37:07.350
You can't be distracted by these things,

37:08.190 --> 37:09.200
especially men.

37:10.060 --> 37:11.220
Stay away from men.

37:11.900 --> 37:12.570
Otherwise,

37:13.170 --> 37:14.970
you will encounter misfortune.

37:15.200 --> 37:16.360
Then why are you

37:16.580 --> 37:18.160
so close to me?

37:18.380 --> 37:19.180
I don't count.

37:19.840 --> 37:21.640
You're a lady disguised as a man?

37:22.450 --> 37:24.270
I'm a real man of seven feet.

37:24.730 --> 37:25.920
Do not insult me.

37:26.290 --> 37:26.920
I'm sorry.

37:29.290 --> 37:29.840
Hey!

37:30.400 --> 37:31.370
Look at you.

37:32.060 --> 37:33.260
You're so impatient.

37:33.830 --> 37:34.880
Girls

37:35.320 --> 37:37.050
should be gentle like a spring,

37:37.180 --> 37:38.640
and reserved like a stone.

37:39.060 --> 37:39.800
Look at you.

37:40.220 --> 37:41.730
You're so loud.

37:42.030 --> 37:44.890
What kind of impression are you leaving for Jin Fan?

37:46.500 --> 37:48.030
Your words are like knives,

37:48.290 --> 37:49.760
cutting into my heart.

37:53.620 --> 37:54.950
Look at your dirty face.

37:57.530 --> 37:58.960
Your beauty

37:59.820 --> 38:01.550
has been covered by the clouds.

38:02.420 --> 38:03.050
Xiaohei,

38:03.420 --> 38:04.690
you're not only considerate,

38:04.690 --> 38:06.090
but also have good taste.

38:08.990 --> 38:10.120
What smells so good?

38:10.300 --> 38:10.810
Hoho.

38:11.410 --> 38:12.740
You have good taste too.

38:13.220 --> 38:14.420
I boiled this handkerchief

38:14.420 --> 38:15.850
in wintersweet on low heat

38:15.850 --> 38:17.270
for a whole night.

38:17.390 --> 38:18.530
The smell lingers

38:20.060 --> 38:21.120
and is refreshing.

38:22.770 --> 38:24.640
You are a man of seven feet

38:24.800 --> 38:26.060
using a fragrant handkerchief?

38:26.060 --> 38:27.060
You have a problem.

38:27.060 --> 38:27.380
Who?

38:27.380 --> 38:27.690
You.

38:27.720 --> 38:28.220
Who stinks?

38:28.220 --> 38:29.070
-You stink.
-Who has a problem?

38:29.070 --> 38:30.130
You have a problem.

38:31.060 --> 38:32.800
Although I'm a craftsman,

38:33.260 --> 38:34.460
I take personal hygiene very seriously

38:34.460 --> 38:35.380
and clean myself too.

38:35.380 --> 38:36.420
All right. Got it.

38:36.950 --> 38:38.000
Stay away from men.

38:38.000 --> 38:38.400
Yes.

38:38.430 --> 38:40.370
Otherwise, I will encounter misfortune.

38:40.370 --> 38:40.750
Yes.

38:43.890 --> 38:44.400
Hey!

38:49.180 --> 38:51.180
Don't just listen to just this line!

38:58.060 --> 38:59.130
Give it to me.

38:59.530 --> 39:00.230
I'll go out

39:00.520 --> 39:02.050
to get the antidote for you.

39:02.570 --> 39:04.100
Give this to Hanya Qi for me.

39:07.540 --> 39:08.270
What is this?

39:08.860 --> 39:10.400
Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapon.

39:10.400 --> 39:11.660
I've drawn a sketch

39:12.020 --> 39:13.680
and retrieved the fragments.

39:13.700 --> 39:15.360
It can help Wufeng research

39:15.620 --> 39:17.470
what kind of poison it is on it.

39:18.100 --> 39:19.630
A Gong family hidden weapon

39:20.060 --> 39:22.250
can be bought at a price on the outside.

39:23.340 --> 39:24.670
You can get the antidote

39:25.250 --> 39:26.270
with just this?

39:27.140 --> 39:29.340
You haven't opened up and researched on

39:29.750 --> 39:31.810
Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapon pouch?

39:32.720 --> 39:34.320
I thought you'd have at least

39:34.390 --> 39:35.790
opened it and took a look.

39:37.980 --> 39:39.490
If I opened it up to research on it

39:39.490 --> 39:40.890
before sending it to you,

39:41.480 --> 39:44.210
you would have been locked up in the prison by now.

39:47.460 --> 39:48.260
You're right.

39:49.130 --> 39:50.760
I should thank you.

39:52.130 --> 39:54.670
The hidden weapons used by Gong Yuanzhi himself

39:54.670 --> 39:57.460
is different from from the normal Gong family secret weapon

39:57.460 --> 39:58.990
that can be bought outside.

39:59.210 --> 40:00.730
It's way more lethal.

40:01.530 --> 40:03.390
The structure is also exquisite.

40:03.610 --> 40:05.540
It's like a craftsman's artwork.

40:08.340 --> 40:08.920
What?

40:10.320 --> 40:11.060
Gunpowder.

40:12.790 --> 40:13.450
Gunpowder?

40:14.820 --> 40:16.420
In the hidden secret weapon,

40:16.890 --> 40:18.020
there's a firing pin

40:18.490 --> 40:19.510
and gunpowder.

40:20.940 --> 40:22.370
When triggered with collision,

40:22.370 --> 40:23.360
it will explode,

40:24.530 --> 40:28.020
causing the metallic blade with the poison to activate a second time.

40:28.020 --> 40:29.960
It can even penetrate armor.

40:31.060 --> 40:31.760
Looks like

40:32.730 --> 40:34.860
you should be able to get the antidote.

40:35.760 --> 40:36.620
What about you?

40:37.110 --> 40:38.640
How is the map coming along?

40:39.490 --> 40:40.820
I'm still short of a lot.

40:41.510 --> 40:42.200
However,

40:42.670 --> 40:43.800
my main takeaway is,

40:44.820 --> 40:48.280
the direction Wufeng was going towards previously was wrong.

40:48.420 --> 40:50.150
The front hill is not the focus.

40:51.700 --> 40:54.300
The most important place in the Gong Residence

40:54.850 --> 40:55.830
is the back hill.

41:03.660 --> 41:04.150
Sir.

41:05.140 --> 41:06.340
Yong Master Yuanzhi.

41:06.740 --> 41:09.870
This is the prescription Miss Shangguan Qian just took.

41:12.590 --> 41:13.130
Two?

41:13.820 --> 41:15.750
She also got a serving for Miss Yun.

41:18.130 --> 41:18.930
You may leave.

41:23.540 --> 41:25.460
Is there any problem with the prescription?

41:25.460 --> 41:26.300
It looks...

41:26.540 --> 41:27.670
like two servings of

41:28.020 --> 41:30.480
medicine that can help cool one's body down.

41:33.320 --> 41:34.240
Medicine?

41:49.200 --> 41:50.240
What happened?

41:53.100 --> 41:54.300
What else could it be?

41:55.050 --> 41:55.890
Jin Fan...

41:57.630 --> 41:58.870
insulted me.

42:00.810 --> 42:03.430
Don't you think you're being too harsh with your words?

42:03.430 --> 42:05.560
I don't think he's that kind of person.

42:05.850 --> 42:07.080
That's who he is.

42:08.680 --> 42:10.080
You know a person's face,

42:11.330 --> 42:12.790
but not their true nature.

42:17.300 --> 42:18.050
What is this?

42:21.260 --> 42:22.990
Today is the Lantern Festival.

42:23.650 --> 42:26.200
I wanted to make him a box of delicate cakes.

42:27.340 --> 42:28.420
I've been working

42:28.950 --> 42:30.340
since morning.

42:31.170 --> 42:33.630
I worked so hard yet he didn't eat anything.

42:34.490 --> 42:35.720
Could it be...

42:35.740 --> 42:37.630
because Guardian Jin is vegetarian

42:37.630 --> 42:39.490
so he's not eating the meat puffs?

42:39.710 --> 42:41.370
This is peach blossom pastry.

42:41.720 --> 42:43.920
Maybe he's allergic to peach blossoms–

42:46.360 --> 42:48.020
This is peach blossom pastry?

42:48.190 --> 42:49.600
How hurtful, Miss Yun.

42:51.810 --> 42:53.750
I'll go teach Guardian Kim a lesson later.

42:53.750 --> 42:54.850
Whatever this is,

42:55.210 --> 42:56.540
it's a gift from you.

43:01.300 --> 43:02.760
My sincerity was returned

43:03.320 --> 43:05.000
with coldness.

43:10.340 --> 43:11.400
Eldest Young Miss.

43:17.220 --> 43:19.010
When I see you making desserts,

43:19.480 --> 43:21.140
it reminds me of my childhood.

43:21.740 --> 43:23.700
Every year on the Lantern Festival,

43:23.700 --> 43:26.810
there will be many delicate pastries sold on the streets every year.

43:26.810 --> 43:27.580
Jujube cake,

43:28.030 --> 43:29.030
osmanthus candy,

43:29.690 --> 43:30.950
dragon's beard candy,

43:31.490 --> 43:33.900
and even salted-egg yolk filling glutinous rice balls.

43:33.900 --> 43:34.690
So many?

43:35.180 --> 43:36.770
There should be some in the

43:36.860 --> 43:38.520
Jiuchen Valley's market too.

43:39.310 --> 43:39.950
Other than

43:39.980 --> 43:42.220
the difference in customs at the borders,

43:42.220 --> 43:43.280
the Lantern Festival

43:43.280 --> 43:45.140
is well-celebrated everywhere.

43:45.660 --> 43:46.720
Jiangnan, Saibei,

43:47.080 --> 43:48.080
Bashu, Jiangliu,

43:49.100 --> 43:51.100
there will be lanterns everywhere.

43:51.140 --> 43:53.640
Thousands of families bustle with the music,

43:53.640 --> 43:55.780
and the lanterns continue for over ten miles.

43:55.780 --> 43:57.980
This talks about the Lantern Festival.

43:58.580 --> 43:59.640
Eldest Young Miss,

44:00.130 --> 44:02.530
haven't you visited the Lantern Festival?

44:03.570 --> 44:04.180
No.

44:05.500 --> 44:06.500
Since I was young,

44:08.260 --> 44:09.880
I have never been out.

44:12.000 --> 44:13.090
What a pity.

44:13.800 --> 44:15.070
I remember a poem.

44:15.880 --> 44:17.740
The colorful sky shines on the ground,

44:17.740 --> 44:19.320
the lights stud the sky.

44:20.160 --> 44:21.760
It looks like stars falling,

44:22.260 --> 44:23.790
and the moon hanging.

44:24.620 --> 44:25.650
It talks about how

44:25.940 --> 44:28.140
people enjoy the lanterns and the moon,

44:28.290 --> 44:29.250
sing and dance.

44:29.660 --> 44:30.720
Young men and women

44:30.820 --> 44:32.770
will express their feelings to each other

44:32.770 --> 44:34.030
on this romantic day.

44:38.470 --> 44:40.550
You've read so many novels.

44:40.970 --> 44:42.370
Do they not talk about it?

44:43.400 --> 44:43.860
They do.

44:44.650 --> 44:45.380
Yes, they do.

44:48.230 --> 44:49.980
Every year at the Lantern Festival,

44:49.980 --> 44:50.900
girls

44:50.900 --> 44:52.580
will dress up nicely.

44:53.060 --> 44:54.100
Because it is said that

44:54.100 --> 44:55.160
it's on this night,

44:55.810 --> 44:58.470
that you'll most likely meet your destined one.

45:00.090 --> 45:01.210
The destined one?

45:04.180 --> 45:05.520
In the sea of lanterns,

45:05.660 --> 45:07.060
people's heads flutter.

45:07.810 --> 45:09.120
If you can meet someone

45:09.330 --> 45:10.660
you like on this night,

45:11.140 --> 45:12.590
it's fate.

45:18.240 --> 45:19.160
Do you know

45:20.100 --> 45:21.650
what the last sentence

45:21.780 --> 45:23.380
of the poem I said just now is?

45:25.370 --> 45:26.970
The laughter of young ladies

45:27.210 --> 45:29.140
sound before the thousand lights.

45:29.990 --> 45:31.160
I can imagine

45:31.680 --> 45:33.550
you shine brightly

45:33.680 --> 45:35.240
under the fireworks.

45:36.400 --> 45:37.540
Fireworks?

45:39.420 --> 45:40.090
Jin

45:40.120 --> 45:41.230
Fan!

45:41.300 --> 45:44.260
Come quickly!

45:44.580 --> 45:45.910
What are we waiting for?

45:51.270 --> 45:52.200
Unfortunately,

45:53.910 --> 45:55.260
we can't go out.

46:02.800 --> 46:03.640
Gong Ziyu.

46:04.120 --> 46:06.440
Gong Ziyu!

46:07.600 --> 46:09.200
Can you be softer?

46:09.980 --> 46:10.780
People who don't know would think

46:10.780 --> 46:11.820
you have great internal skill

46:11.820 --> 46:12.940
and can shout across a thousand miles.

46:12.940 --> 46:14.140
Your voice is so loud.

46:15.490 --> 46:17.970
There are fewer birds in the yard recently too.

46:17.970 --> 46:18.580
Jin Fan.

46:19.450 --> 46:20.070
Sit.

46:28.590 --> 46:29.420
Do you know

46:29.500 --> 46:31.130
what day it is today?

46:32.370 --> 46:33.630
The Lantern Festival?

46:35.740 --> 46:36.470
Guess again.

46:41.030 --> 46:42.170
Are you trying to say

46:42.480 --> 46:44.280
it's a big day for you and Jin Fan?

46:45.870 --> 46:47.070
Do you think I am

46:47.100 --> 46:48.480
someone who only thinks about

46:48.480 --> 46:49.620
love and laugh all day long

46:49.620 --> 46:51.200
and not do my job?

46:51.370 --> 46:52.310
You are.

46:54.500 --> 46:55.810
Today is the big day

46:55.850 --> 46:57.450
we celebrate your passing of

46:57.460 --> 46:58.390
the first trial.

46:59.620 --> 47:01.420
It was the day before yesterday.

47:01.580 --> 47:04.210
No matter which day it was, we have to celebrate it.

47:04.210 --> 47:05.830
A good meal is never too late.

47:06.130 --> 47:07.910
Good girls don't slack off.

47:08.610 --> 47:10.610
To celebrate your success,

47:11.060 --> 47:13.290
let's go to the market tonight.

47:13.550 --> 47:14.680
It's inappropriate

47:15.330 --> 47:17.590
to leave the Gong Residence at this time.

47:19.000 --> 47:20.780
Miss Yun wants to go too.

47:24.670 --> 47:25.260
Really?

47:25.750 --> 47:26.750
You want to go too?

47:28.940 --> 47:29.290
Sure.

47:30.640 --> 47:31.440
Let's go then.

47:33.450 --> 47:34.250
But Miss Yun,

47:34.280 --> 47:35.440
as a foreign bride,

47:36.510 --> 47:37.390
the elders

47:37.570 --> 47:40.170
wouldn't allow her to leave the palace, right?

47:43.840 --> 47:45.140
If it will cause inconvenience

47:45.140 --> 47:46.340
to the Sword Wielder,

47:46.540 --> 47:47.470
I won't go.

47:47.860 --> 47:50.060
I can celebrate the festival alone too.

47:50.100 --> 47:51.500
Enjoy your celebration.

47:51.760 --> 47:54.290
No need to ask the elders for things like this.

47:55.260 --> 47:57.120
I know the secret passage to leave

47:57.380 --> 47:58.510
the Gong Residence.

48:01.020 --> 48:01.740
Miss Yun.

48:02.010 --> 48:02.620
Let's go.

48:02.920 --> 48:04.040
Let's get changed.

48:28.650 --> 48:30.600
It'll be dark in the secret tunnel.

48:32.390 --> 48:33.590
I will hold your hand.

48:47.460 --> 48:49.630
We haven't reached the secret tunnel yet.

48:49.630 --> 48:51.630
Why is he holding her in such a hurry?

48:53.430 --> 48:54.920
I heard it's dark inside.

48:55.620 --> 48:56.530
Hold me tight.

48:57.240 --> 48:58.190
I'm scared too.

48:59.420 --> 49:01.550
That's why you have to hold me tightly.

49:02.180 --> 49:03.380
Then I'm more scared.

49:16.610 --> 49:17.670
Should I report it?

49:18.490 --> 49:19.820
He's the Sword Wielder.

49:20.340 --> 49:22.140
Who are you going to report it to?

49:24.780 --> 49:26.250
Young Master Shangjue is in charge of things outside of the Gong residence.

49:26.250 --> 49:28.580
We'll report it to Young Master Shangjue.

49:33.120 --> 49:34.380
Young Master Yuanzhi.

49:42.940 --> 49:44.200
Young Master Yuanzhi.

49:44.290 --> 49:45.750
What a beautiful lantern.

49:46.180 --> 49:47.430
Young Master Shangjue was born in the year of dragon.

49:47.430 --> 49:49.630
This must be for Young Master Shangjue.

49:50.170 --> 49:52.500
My brother doesn't like useless things like this.

49:52.500 --> 49:53.150
But

49:53.380 --> 49:54.730
I thought it'd be nice

49:54.940 --> 49:56.760
to make the room brighter

49:56.910 --> 49:58.310
on the Lantern Festival.

49:58.740 --> 49:59.940
You made it yourself?

50:03.010 --> 50:03.880
Where is my brother?

50:03.880 --> 50:05.210
I'm here to eat with him.

50:05.860 --> 50:07.210
Young Master Shangjue and Miss Shangguan Qian

50:07.210 --> 50:08.690
are already having dinner.

50:08.690 --> 50:09.500
The servants

50:09.500 --> 50:11.280
started a fire at the the backyard's pavilion.

50:11.280 --> 50:12.480
They should be there.

50:16.400 --> 50:18.540
Would you like to have dinner with them together?

50:18.540 --> 50:21.370
Let me go report this to Young Master Shangjue first.

50:21.370 --> 50:21.870
No need.

50:23.140 --> 50:23.870
Understood.

50:46.740 --> 50:49.200
Young Master Shangjue normally eats alone.

50:49.460 --> 50:50.580
Why did you

50:50.860 --> 50:52.470
invite me to dinner today?

50:53.650 --> 50:55.380
Today is the Lantern Festival.

50:55.940 --> 50:56.700
We should

50:57.060 --> 50:57.960
celebrate.

50:59.480 --> 51:00.690
In the past,

51:00.990 --> 51:03.520
you must've gone shopping and watched shows,

51:04.150 --> 51:05.810
admire the stars and the moon,

51:06.090 --> 51:07.240
and lanterns

51:07.860 --> 51:09.720
with your relatives and friends.

51:09.900 --> 51:10.360
Right?

51:12.930 --> 51:15.130
I wasn't in good health when I was young.

51:15.430 --> 51:16.680
I didn't go out often.

51:18.170 --> 51:20.270
The Lantern Festival at the Gong Residence

51:20.270 --> 51:21.400
is not as happening.

51:23.850 --> 51:25.850
I thought you might not be used to it.

51:27.060 --> 51:27.800
Just right,

51:28.570 --> 51:29.900
I'm done with my work,

51:31.660 --> 51:33.120
so I came to accompany you.

51:37.500 --> 51:39.030
You must have suffered a lot

51:39.770 --> 51:41.500
marrying into the Gong family.

51:44.020 --> 51:45.230
One may suffer

51:45.940 --> 51:47.670
marrying into the Gong family.

51:48.850 --> 51:50.850
But marrying Young Master Shangjue

51:52.140 --> 51:53.800
does not make me suffer at all.

52:07.820 --> 52:08.880
Actually,

52:09.260 --> 52:10.920
you don't like crowds, do you?

52:13.970 --> 52:14.640
No I don't.

52:17.270 --> 52:18.800
Then I don't like it either.

52:19.780 --> 52:20.610
Can you change

52:22.060 --> 52:23.020
what you like?

52:25.370 --> 52:26.040
Of course.

52:27.230 --> 52:28.920
People develop likings

52:29.850 --> 52:31.530
after they are born.

52:33.770 --> 52:35.600
But hatred can be born with.

52:38.580 --> 52:39.940
Some people are born

52:41.100 --> 52:41.990
with hatred.

52:44.700 --> 52:45.380
Yes.

52:46.490 --> 52:47.620
In this world,

52:48.360 --> 52:50.020
there is no love for no reason,

52:51.660 --> 52:53.520
but there is hatred for no reason.

52:55.370 --> 52:57.630
The two people who may not have met before

52:58.850 --> 53:00.530
can be enemies.

53:05.400 --> 53:07.200
Gong family has many enemies.

53:11.410 --> 53:12.690
Your enemy

53:13.780 --> 53:14.920
is my enemy.

53:20.180 --> 53:21.510
You're good at talking.

53:24.380 --> 53:24.980
Am I wrong?

53:29.050 --> 53:30.080
You just said

53:31.370 --> 53:32.710
my enemy

53:33.440 --> 53:34.580
is your enemy

53:35.500 --> 53:36.550
instead of

53:37.470 --> 53:38.640
Gong family's enemy

53:39.500 --> 53:40.650
is your enemy.

53:43.820 --> 53:45.220
Is there any difference?

53:48.680 --> 53:49.430
No.

53:58.060 --> 53:59.180
The top row

53:59.210 --> 54:01.270
is the prescription for Yun Weishan.

54:02.220 --> 54:03.490
The next row

54:03.840 --> 54:05.840
is Shangguan Qian's prescription.

54:08.940 --> 54:10.870
It can't be just a simple medicine.

54:12.290 --> 54:14.420
There must be something wrong with it.

54:22.950 --> 54:24.280
Bulbophyllum Thouars,

54:25.490 --> 54:26.750
Fern-leaf corydalis.

54:27.250 --> 54:28.310
Angelfish orchid.

54:29.040 --> 54:30.160
Naked Star Bug.

54:31.060 --> 54:32.390
Bulbophyllum Levinei.

54:32.700 --> 54:33.770
Young Master Shangjue,

54:33.770 --> 54:35.230
would you like to try some?

54:36.260 --> 54:37.250
I've been decocting

54:37.250 --> 54:38.910
this medicine all afternoon.

54:42.500 --> 54:43.430
On top of that...

54:45.540 --> 54:47.440
with brown-core cape jasmine,

54:47.960 --> 54:49.960
Chinese liquorice that has budded,

54:49.960 --> 54:51.960
and amber with caterpillar fungus.

55:01.310 --> 55:03.660
With just cinnabar and saltpeter,

55:06.380 --> 55:07.510
this will be lethal.

55:08.810 --> 55:09.670
This is lethal.

55:11.580 --> 55:12.110
Brother!
